      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What does the client show under \"Delay\" in the networking debug menu (check https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/keyboard-and-mouse on how to open that) for the users cutting out? If you can reliably reproduce the problem, compare the delay of the users before the problem and after the problem starts appearing.\nThis issue could be related to https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/movementik-starts-lagging-after-staying-35-hours-in-the-same-instance where the symptoms are the same, just the cause to get there seems to be a different one.",
