      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b8cc39b2734df12abfb8347|full_name}: At the start of the lobby it stayed at about 0.3, then gradually rises to 1.9 (after about stated time) where seems to be the max threshold before it sets in, as then jumped to 2.2 while slowly rising beyond that nonstop. (pure silence at 2.4 beyond)",
